// Ring V, the Hunt (design/LABYRINTH.md §6 Ring V, Scenes E and F; LABYRINTH_MAZE.md;
// design/phase4/SCRIPT.md beat III-3J; design/maps/LabyrinthRing5.md).
// Layout and events: tools/ichor/maps/labyrinth_heart.py (56 x 48, mychos, dark).
//
// Asterion walks a paved ring road round an underground lake, clockwise, all day.
// The Titans watch him from a grated gallery above the water and never go down.
// Outside the road the house has fallen into the karst: a cave maze to the north,
// west and east, and a dark one to the south that only crosses of his road reach.
// Four corner spurs run on past the road's corners, three of them into cracked
// walls, so a player standing in a pool of sunlight at a spur's end can lure his
// charge through the wall: %1 Minos's tomb (east), %2 a shortcut south, %3 a
// treasure room (west).
//
// Warps: 0-1 the stair up to Ring IV, 2-3 the stair down to Ring VI, 4-5 the
// stair down into Minos's tomb, 6 the rope up to Ring IV. The sinkhole at (45,44)
// drops into Ring VI at the same cell.

